## 5. THE CALLER-LOCATION OWNER — `CompositionPoint`

```csharp
// added to analyzers/AgentGuard.Analyzers/CompositionPoint.cs, beside the existing type-level sites
internal static bool IsContainerFactory(ISymbol? symbol);
internal static bool IsInsideContainerFactory(
    SemanticModel semanticModel, int position, CancellationToken cancellationToken);
