`IsContainerFactory` = `IMethodSymbol { IsStatic: true, MethodKind: MethodKind.Ordinary }` named `Create` whose containing type passes `WellKnownType.IsInAssembly(type, EngineAssembly.Name, ContainerFactoryTypeName, EngineAssembly.Name)`. `ContainerFactoryTypeName = "SystemServices"` already exists at `CompositionPoint.cs:27`.

